          "title": "无护照过海关",
          "content": "<p>从2024年9月30日开始，新加坡公民通过樟宜机场出入境，不再需要护照了。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202412/bg2024122904.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>机场会使用人脸识别和虹膜识别，来代替护照。这样更省时、成本更低。</p>\n<p>纸制护照已经过时了，也许不久将来就会消失。</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "无护照过海关",
              "url": "https://www.ica.gov.sg/news-and-publications/newsroom/media-release/passport-less-clearance-fully-rolled-out-at-changi-airport"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202412/bg2024122904.webp"
